<body>

    <!-- HEADER -->
    <header>
        <h1>Supreme Court Under the 1973 Constitution</h1>

        <p>
            An educational website about the structure, powers,
            jurisdiction, and historical role of the Supreme Court
            under the 1973 Constitution of the Philippines.
        </p>
    </header>

